{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0.0",
  "contentVersion": "2026.11.10.2",
  "hexagramId": 63,
  "name": "水火既济",
  "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
  "trustScope": "source-commentary-only;not-authoritative-rules-or-proven-outcomes",
  "attributions": "作者名为原稿所署，未核验独立出版版本；新补文字不署作这些作者原话",
  "groups": [
    {
      "key": "intro",
      "label": "卦义",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "卦辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08537",
              "text": "既济：亨小，利贞；初吉终乱。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08537",
                "bodyParagraph": 8473
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08538",
              "text": "【白话】《既济卦》象征成功：此时功德完满，连柔小者都亨通顺利，有利于坚守正道；开始时是吉祥的，但如有不慎，终久必导致混乱。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08538",
                "bodyParagraph": 8474
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08539",
              "text": "《象》曰：“水在火上，既济；君子以思患而预防之。”",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08539",
                "bodyParagraph": 8475
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08540",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：《既济卦》的卦象是离（火）下坎（水）上，为水在火上之表象，比喻用火煮食物，食物已熟，象征事情已经成功；君子应有远大的目光，在事情成功之后，就要考虑将来可能出现的种种弊端，防患于未然，采取预防措施。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08540",
                "bodyParagraph": 8476
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "卦义与哲学解读",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08542",
              "text": "既济卦坎上离下，水在火上，阴阳六爻各得其位，象征事情已经完成。但卦辞“初吉终乱”提醒人：成功不是终点，若停止警戒，容易盛极而衰。《象》说“君子以思患而预防之”，正是防微杜渐、居安思危。事业上要巩固成果又应防止僵化；经商更需密切观察市场变化，切勿因一时得利而盲目扩张。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08542",
                "bodyParagraph": 8478
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-1",
      "position": 1,
      "label": "初九",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08545",
              "text": "初九，曳其轮，濡其尾，无咎。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08545",
                "bodyParagraph": 8481
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08546",
              "text": "【白话】初九，拉住车的轮子，不使它快进，小狐狸渡河时沾湿了尾巴，无法快游，没有灾祸。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08546",
                "bodyParagraph": 8482
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08547",
              "text": "《象》曰：“曳其轮”，义无咎也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08547",
                "bodyParagraph": 8483
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08548",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“拉住车的轮子，不使它快进”，说明事情成功之后，必须谨慎从事，小心防备，才没有灾祸。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08548",
                "bodyParagraph": 8484
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08550",
              "text": "平。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08550",
                "bodyParagraph": 8486
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08552",
              "text": "初九爻动，变为第39卦《蹇卦》（水山蹇）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08552",
                "bodyParagraph": 8488
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08554",
              "text": "初九“曳其轮，濡其尾，无咎”，拖住车轮、放慢渡河之速，显示初有成效时应稳住局面，防止冒进破坏稳定。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08554",
                "bodyParagraph": 8490
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-2",
      "position": 2,
      "label": "六二",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08557",
              "text": "六二，妇丧其茀，勿逐，七日得。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08557",
                "bodyParagraph": 8493
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08558",
              "text": "【白话】六二，丢失了妇人乘车的遮帘，不用去寻找，过不了七天就会物归原处。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08558",
                "bodyParagraph": 8494
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08559",
              "text": "《象》曰：“七日得”，以中道也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08559",
                "bodyParagraph": 8495
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08560",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“丢失妇人乘车上的遮帘，过不了七日就会物归原处”，说明此时正处于中位，坚守正道，不偏不倚，所以丢失了的东西可以失而复得。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08560",
                "bodyParagraph": 8496
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08562",
              "text": "平。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08562",
                "bodyParagraph": 8498
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08564",
              "text": "六二爻动，变为第5卦《需卦》（水天需）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08564",
                "bodyParagraph": 8500
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08566",
              "text": "六二“妇丧其茀，勿逐，七日得”，贵妇丢失车帷或遮饰，不必急追，守中正而候其自然恢复。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08566",
                "bodyParagraph": 8502
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-3",
      "position": 3,
      "label": "九三",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08569",
              "text": "九三，高宗伐鬼方，三年克之；小人勿用。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08569",
                "bodyParagraph": 8505
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08570",
              "text": "【白话】九三，殷高宗武丁征伐地处西北的鬼方国，经过三年的连续战斗才获得胜利；不可任用急躁冒进的小人。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08570",
                "bodyParagraph": 8506
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08571",
              "text": "《象》曰：“三年克之”，惫也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08571",
                "bodyParagraph": 8507
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08572",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“经过三年的连续战斗才攻克了鬼方国”，说明战争非常激烈又持续了三年之久，已经筋疲力尽了，胜利是来之不易的。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08572",
                "bodyParagraph": 8508
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08574",
              "text": "凶。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08574",
                "bodyParagraph": 8510
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08576",
              "text": "九三爻动，变为第3卦《屯卦》（水雷屯）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08576",
                "bodyParagraph": 8512
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08578",
              "text": "九三“高宗伐鬼方，三年克之，小人勿用”，长期战争耗费巨大，即使终得胜利，也不应纵容急功近利之人。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08578",
                "bodyParagraph": 8514
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-4",
      "position": 4,
      "label": "六四",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08581",
              "text": "六四，繻有衣袽，终日戒。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08581",
                "bodyParagraph": 8517
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08582",
              "text": "【白话】六四，渡河的时候，为了防止船漏水，事先要准备破布棉絮，而且整天保持戒备，以防止发生灾祸。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08582",
                "bodyParagraph": 8518
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08583",
              "text": "《象》曰：“终日戒”，有所疑也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08583",
                "bodyParagraph": 8519
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08584",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“整天保持戒备，以防止灾祸的发生”，说明此时心中有所疑虑，感到恐惧。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08584",
                "bodyParagraph": 8520
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08586",
              "text": "平。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08586",
                "bodyParagraph": 8522
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08588",
              "text": "六四爻动，变为第49卦《革卦》（泽火革）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08588",
                "bodyParagraph": 8524
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08590",
              "text": "六四“繻有衣袽，终日戒”，古人以破布堵漏船的缝隙为喻，提醒成功之后须不断检查隐患、整日戒备。源网页的六四“哲学含义”误接九三与九五内容，整理时应删除错接段落。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08590",
                "bodyParagraph": 8526
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-5",
      "position": 5,
      "label": "九五",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08593",
              "text": "九五，东邻杀牛，不如西邻之禴祭，实受其福。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08593",
                "bodyParagraph": 8529
              },
              "patchIds": [
                "detail-edit-0123"
              ],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08594",
              "text": "【白话】九五，东边邻国杀牛羊来举行盛大祭礼，不如西边的邻国举行简单而朴素的祭祀，这样才能实在地得到神降赐的福分。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08594",
                "bodyParagraph": 8530
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08595",
              "text": "《象》曰：“东邻杀牛”，不如西邻之时也；“实受其福”，吉大来也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08595",
                "bodyParagraph": 8531
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08596",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“东边的邻国杀牛宰羊来举行盛大的祭礼”，还不如西边邻国能按时举行虔诚简单的时祭；西邻“实在地得到上天神灵降赐的福分”，说明此是正当其位，吉祥福分将不断隆临，非常幸运。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08596",
                "bodyParagraph": 8532
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08598",
              "text": "吉。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08598",
                "bodyParagraph": 8534
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08600",
              "text": "九五爻动，变为第36卦《明夷卦》（地火明夷）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08600",
                "bodyParagraph": 8536
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08602",
              "text": "九五“东邻杀牛，不如西邻之禴祭”，盛大排场不如恰当时机和真诚心意，告诫胜利之后不必奢靡与好大喜功。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08602",
                "bodyParagraph": 8538
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-6",
      "position": 6,
      "label": "上六",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08605",
              "text": "上六，濡其首，厉。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08605",
                "bodyParagraph": 8541
              },
              "patchIds": [
                "detail-edit-0124"
              ],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08606",
              "text": "【白话】上六，小狐狸渡河时弄湿了头，有危险。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08606",
                "bodyParagraph": 8542
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08607",
              "text": "《象》曰：“濡其首，厉”，何可久也！",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08607",
                "bodyParagraph": 8543
              },
              "patchIds": [
                "detail-edit-0125"
              ],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08608",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“小狐狸渡河时弄湿了头，有危险”，这是警告在事情成功之后，要更加小心谨慎，不然怎能长久不败！",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08608",
                "bodyParagraph": 8544
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08610",
              "text": "凶。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08610",
                "bodyParagraph": 8546
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08612",
              "text": "上六爻动，变为第37卦《家人卦》（风火家人）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08612",
                "bodyParagraph": 8548
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08614",
              "text": "上六“濡其首，厉”，渡河时水淹过头，喻成事之极仍向前冒进，危险就在眼前。应保持警醒与节制。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08614",
                "bodyParagraph": 8550
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "文本校勘",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08616",
              "text": "原网页的六四哲学含义段落串入九三“高宗伐鬼方”和九五“东邻杀牛”，本版将两者归到原有爻位，六四单独按“繻有衣袽，终日戒”解释。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08616",
                "bodyParagraph": 8552
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "excludedParagraphs": 0
}
